    "title": "Budget-three fiber-two c=1 parity R0 trace and scalar gates are lift-free",
    "status": "PROVED",
    "closure": "proof",
    "statement": "For the sole potentially anti-invariant R0 role, put u=r^2 and t=u^2. Its two source traces are exactly the roots of K_t(Y)=t(Y-2)^2+4(t-1)^2. A 39-step recurrence modulo this separable quadratic is an exact lift-free outer-torsion test. Eliminating Y from S^2=(Y+2)T gives the exact scalar identity t(S^2-4T)^2+4(t-1)^2T^2=0; a common coefficient gcd enforces the same trace in both gates. Every survivor consequently obeys 4t(1+tH^2)^2+(t-1)^2=0. This does not exclude R0 or discharge its fourth-power and gcd gates.",
